## 全局UI规范（所有页面类任务最高优先级强制执行）
1. 开发/修改任何页面前，必须先遍历项目现有UI组件库；布局、卡片、标准区块、正文排版类需求，100%优先复用已有组件（Grid/Card/Section/Prose等），禁止手写重复功能的原生标签+自定义类名。
2. 绝对禁止创建无对应CSS定义的自定义类名；禁止自行实现网格布局、卡片容器、标准内容区块、正文排版等已有组件覆盖的基础UI能力。
3. 所有正文文本区块必须统一使用Prose组件包裹，禁止裸写h2/h3/p标签脱离设计系统。⚠️ 同时注意：已自带样式的独立区块组件（如CapabilityShowcase、Hero、FeatureGrid等）不得被放置在Prose组件或prose类的父容器内部，否则Prose的全局排版样式会污染该组件的自有样式。若布局组件的默认<slot/>被prose包裹，必须使用具名slot将独立区块组件移到prose容器外部。
4. 页面局部差异化样式仅可写在当前页面的私有<style>块内，必须沿用项目现有设计Token，禁止硬编码颜色、间距、字号等基础样式值。

# Windsurf rules

AI-operable Astro starter. Stay on-system; do not improvise design/architecture.

Read first: system/globals/ (design KB), src/registry.json.

Rules:
- Design tokens only. No hardcoded hex/rgb, no Tailwind palette utilities
  (bg-blue-500). Use semantic tokens (bg-primary, text-foreground,
  var(--muted-foreground)). Palette is monochrome OKLCH.
- Dark mode via the .dark class; never hand-invert colors.
- Three tiers: Components -> Sections (src/components/sections) -> Pages.
- i18n: English default + Indonesian /id/. Every route exists in both
  src/pages/x.astro and src/pages/[locale]/x.astro.
- Preserve Git-based Markdown content, Cloudflare Pages, SEO (OG, JSON-LD,
  sitemap, RSS, robots, llms.txt), Pagefind, Starlight docs.
- Static Astro by default; React islands only when interaction requires it.

Verify: run `pnpm lint` (includes `pnpm check:kpis`) and `pnpm build` before done.

## ── Material Content Generation (trigger-scoped strong constraint) ──

**Trigger scenario:** When the task involves adding or modifying titanium material grade content, the `materials` content collection, or knowledge-base material pages, the rules below become **hard constraints** that override any default AI behavior.

### ✅ Allowed (the only correct operations)
- Create or modify Markdown files under `src/content/core/materials/` following the existing schema in `src/content.config.ts` (materials collection)
- Use standard Markdown syntax only (h2 `##`, h3 `###`, p, ul, ol, table) for body content
- Fill all structured data (grade, alloy, standards, industries, processes, finishes, certifications, properties) in the Frontmatter block — the `_EntityDetail` layout component renders these automatically

### ❌ Prohibited (absolute bans)
- Creating any new `.astro` page files for material content (existing dynamic routes at `src/pages/knowledge/materials/[slug].astro` handle rendering)
- Adding custom CSS classes, inline styles, or hardcoded hex/rgb colors anywhere
- Modifying `global.css`, `content.config.ts`, `astro.config.*`, `site.config.ts`, `registry.json`, or any layout/component files
- Adding custom Frontmatter fields beyond the `materials` collection schema
- Writing `#` (H1) in Markdown body — H1 is rendered by `_EntityDetail` layout
- Duplicating property/parameter tables in body text that already exist in Frontmatter `properties` field (those render automatically as a spec table)

### 📋 Body section order convention (titanium materials)
Follow this sequence for Markdown body sections. Sections may be omitted, but must not be reordered:
1. `## Overview` — material description, key characteristics
2. `## Chemical Composition` — alloying elements and percentages
3. `## Mechanical Properties` — strength, hardness, elongation data
4. `## Machining Characteristics` — feeds, speeds, tooling recommendations
5. `## Typical Applications` — industry-specific use cases
6. `## Certifications & Standards` — applicable ASTM/ISO/AMS specs
7. `## FAQ` — common buyer/engineer questions

### 🧩 Prose usage rule
- **In content collection Markdown files:** No manual wrapping needed. The dynamic route and `_EntityDetail` layout already apply `prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-none` styling. Just write raw Markdown.
- **In `.astro` page templates:** If writing body HTML directly, wrap all text content inside `<Prose>` component (imported from `@/components/ui/content/Prose/Prose.astro`) or apply `class="prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-none"` to the container div.

